      "writtenOn": "2016-08-11T04:31:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having Finish increase the pending buffer size and Release decrement it seems strange to me.  I guess the problems it that you have two stages of completion, cpu work done and memory freed.  Could you get a similar parallelism with a single completion for cpu+memory? Maybe by doubling the number of goroutines to make sure the ones waiting for memory to be released don\u0027t prevent spawning new cpu work?",
      "revId": "a169de21c613490b357d848cb61b24a6e9cd60a4",
